Usage of ./bench:
  -data string
    	path to data directory (default "./data")
  -debug
    	add debugging info into request header
  -duration duration
    	benchamrk duration (default 1m0s)
  -jobid string
    	job id
  -nolevelup
    	dont increase load level
  -output string
    	path to write result json
  -portal string
    	portal site url (only used at workermode) (default "http://localhost:8888")
  -remotes string
    	remote addrs to benchmark (default "localhost:8080")
  -tempdir string
    	path to temp dir
  -test
    	run pretest only
  -workermode
    	workermode
